title: "rlvr-audit: Diagnostic CLI for Advantage Collapse in Group-Relative RLVR"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-22
authors:
  - family-names: Bhat
    given-names: Krishnakumar
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22870159
repository-code: "https://github.com/krishnakumarbhat/rlvr-audit"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - rlvr
  - grpo
  - reinforcement-learning
  - diagnostics
  - advantage-collapse
abstract: >-
  Diagnostic CLI for detecting advantage collapse, zero-variance prompts,
  and normalizer transport issues in Group-Relative RLVR. Scores group-reward
  logs against the closed-form finite-G signal surface with SymPy-verified
  identities.
